      (e.g., ndarray
      (<xref alt="rust-ndarray developers, 2026" rid="ref-ndarray" ref-type="bibr">rust-ndarray
      developers, 2026</xref>)) are omitted.
      <styled-content id="tabU003Acomparison"></styled-content></p>
    </caption>
